Package: k7ctl
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${python3:Depends}, pipewire-bin, wireplumber
Recommends: python3-pyqt6
Description: FiiO K7 DAC/amp status and bit-perfect setup for PipeWire
 Shows what the FiiO K7 USB DAC/headphone amp is playing (sample rate, bit
 depth, PCM or DSD) and its firmware version, lets PipeWire switch the K7 to
 the native sample rate of the music instead of resampling everything to
 48 kHz, and checks that PipeWire's volume isn't throwing away resolution.
 Includes a command line tool with JSON output and a system tray icon (needs
 PyQt6 or PySide6).
